+The old 33-owner publication is historical and is never changed here. The 62
+cold phases did NOT pack their EXEs. Five different actual phases packed a
+separate, source-produced, byte-identical EXE twice. Neither equality axis adds
+authored source bytes, canonical ledger credit, Factory acceptance or a
+whole-game percentage. All verification is read-only and launches no native tool.
